<span begin="00:45.443" end="00:45.658">just </span><span begin="00:45.658" end="00:46.137">have </span><span begin="00:46.137" end="00:46.344">to </span><span begin="00:46.344" end="00:46.671">let </span><span begin="00:46.671" end="00:46.978">you </span><span begin="00:46.978" end="00:47.481">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.992" end="00:55.416"><span begin="00:50.992" end="00:51.320">I'm </span><span begin="00:51.320" end="00:51.703">not </span><span begin="00:51.703" end="00:52.582">tryna </span><span begin="00:52.582" end="00:52.837">start </span><span begin="00:52.837" end="00:52.996">a </span><span begin="00:52.996" end="00:54.315">fire </span><span begin="00:54.315" end="00:54.514">with </span><span begin="00:54.514" end="00:54.745">this </span><span begin="00:54.745" end="00:55.416">flame</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.281" end="01:01.209"><span begin="00:57.281" end="00:57.488">But </span><span begin="00:57.488" end="00:57.903">I'm </span><span begin="00:57.903" end="00:58.744">worried </span><span begin="00:58.744" end="00:58.919">that </span><span begin="00:58.919" end="00:59.182">your </span><span begin="00:59.182" end="01:00.109">heart </span><span begin="01:00.109" end="01:00.277">might </span><span begin="01:00.277" end="01:00.507">feel </span><span begin="01:00.507" end="01:00.722">the </span><span begin="01:00.722" end="01:01.209">same</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.619" end="01:04.401"><span begin="01:01.619" end="01:01.826">And </span><span begin="01:01.826" end="01:01.985">I </span><span begin="01:01.985" end="01:02.240">have </span><span begin="01:02.240" end="01:02.415">to </span><span begin="01:02.415" end="01:02.622">be </span><span begin="01:02.622" end="01:03.501">honest </span><span begin="01:03.501" end="01:03.676">with </span><span begin="01:03.676" end="01:03.859">you </span><span begin="01:03.859" end="01:04.401">baby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.659" end="01:07.438"><span begin="01:04.659" end="01:04.950">Tell </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.181">me </span><span begin="01:05.181" end="01:05.404">if </span><span begin="01:05.404" end="01:05.659">I'm </span><span begin="01:05.659" end="01:06.330">wrong </span><span begin="01:06.330" end="01:06.497">and </span><span begin="01:06.497" end="01:06.720">this </span><span begin="01:06.720" end="01:06.903">is </span><span begin="01:06.903" end="01:07.438">crazy</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.711" end="01:09.233"><span begin="01:07.711" end="01:07.918">But </span><span begin="01:07.918" end="01:08.093">I </span><span begin="01:08.093" end="01:08.300">got </span><span begin="01:08.300" end="01:08.459">you </span><span begin="01:08.459" end="01:08.698">this </span><span begin="01:08.698" end="01:09.233">rose</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.399" end="01:10.610"><span begin="01:09.399" end="01:09.566">And </span><span begin="01:09.566" end="01:09.725">I </span><span begin="01:09.725" end="01:09.996">need </span><span begin="01:09.996" end="01:10.235">to </span><span begin="01:10.235" end="01:10.610">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.479" end="01:14.806"><span begin="01:12.479" end="01:12.847">Will </span><span begin="01:12.847" end="01:13.029">you </span><span begin="01:13.029" end="01:13.212">let </span><span begin="01:13.212" end="01:13.387">it </span><span begin="01:13.387" end="01:13.762">die </span><span begin="01:13.762" end="01:14.001">or </span><span begin="01:14.001" end="01:14.232">let </span><span begin="01:14.232" end="01:14.471">it </span><span begin="01:14.471" end="01:14.806">grow</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.727" end="01:20.970"><span begin="01:19.727" end="01:19.918">Die </span><span begin="01:19.918" end="01:20.277">or </span><span begin="01:20.277" end="01:20.444">let </span><span begin="01:20.444" end="01:20.643">it </span><span begin="01:20.643" end="01:20.970">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.919" end="01:31.301"><span begin="01: